So How Should createRefreshToken() Work?

Instead of generating a JWT again, I recommend generating a cryptographically secure random token.

Why?

Refresh tokens are opaque tokens.

Google

Microsoft

Amazon

Netflix

Most enterprise systems do not use JWTs for refresh tokens.

Instead:

8af8b33c8ef04bff8bded90d5d...

A random string.

Advantages:

Cannot be decoded.
Smaller payload.
Easy to revoke.
Easy to rotate.
More secure if hashed before storage.
